    "detailed_description": "Each round pits two random YouTube videos against each other. Your task is to guess which video has more views or more comments.<br><br>You can choose which topic the videos are about using a list of pre-defined topics - or you can create your own based on your own interests.<br><br>You can play the game on your own or you can play online with up three other friends (so 4 players total) thanks to Steam's Remote Play Together feature. All players secretly submit their guesses and the correct answers and the winners are revealed when everyone has answered.<br><br>If a video looks particularly interesting, you can click it to open it up in your browser.<br><br>There are currently 15 achievements in the game waiting to be unlocked.<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "Each round pits two random YouTube videos against each other. Your task is to guess which video has more views or more comments.<br><br>You can choose which topic the videos are about using a list of pre-defined topics - or you can create your own based on your own interests.<br><br>You can play the game on your own or you can play online with up three other friends (so 4 players total) thanks to Steam's Remote Play Together feature. All players secretly submit their guesses and the correct answers and the winners are revealed when everyone has answered.<br><br>If a video looks particularly interesting, you can click it to open it up in your browser.<br><br>There are currently 15 achievements in the game waiting to be unlocked.<br><br>",
    "short_description": "Which YouTube video is more popular or engaging? Pick a topic and guess which of two YouTube videos has more views or more comments. Test your social media skills: How many can you get right?",
